WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.918 --> 00:00:15.386
Solv Production runs at the desk, on the shift lead's tablet and on a terminal at every machine. One program, the same data, each person sees their own work.

2
00:00:16.016 --> 00:00:28.316
The menu covers the flow from order to customer: orders, planning, shop floor, quality, master data.

3
00:00:29.767 --> 00:00:39.650
The tray division is in scope, closed in this demo. Lamination, slitting and bags come first, one process after another.

4
00:00:40.284 --> 00:00:51.465
It reads customers, articles, stock and purchases from the plant's own ERP. No new ERP: Solv Production works beside the one the plant has.

5
00:00:52.099 --> 00:01:04.331
The demo plant at real size: 105 orders in three weeks, 1,265 reels and cartons, 358 stops on record. Every record was made by the program's own commands.

6
00:01:08.963 --> 00:01:15.768
The shift lead sees every machine: what runs, what stands, how today has gone.

7
00:01:20.403 --> 00:01:26.439
At the machine, the operator sees only the work of his own machine.
